	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"As the sun begins to set, the field trip comes to a peaceful end.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I am currently accompanying Empress Hisui as her assigned escort.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Meanwhile, Elsa is elsewhere directing the Republican students.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"This is the perfect chance to win Kanami over to our side.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami, can we have a little talk?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“This is not some casual conversation, is it?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Kanami tightens her expression.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We've told Inou everything.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Kanami and Hotori share a meaningful look with each other.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"The two of them have been together ever since they were children.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Is that really you, Kanami?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Sorry, Hotori-chan. I never told you...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hotori-chan, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Hotori shows her a warm smile.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You've grown so beautiful, Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You've changed so much, I never could've guessed it was you.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oh, yeah. My hair used to be black.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Though, you also talk a little differently from how you used to.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You sorta seem more mature now.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The way I talk, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, you could say I've grown up a little.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Hotori lets out a self-deprecating laugh.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"It was only after the war that Hotori took on her rugged manner of speaking.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Drowning in self-blame for leading the Myougi Squad to ruin, she lost all confidence in being able to talk to others.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Even so, she forced herself to do so, and the result was that her words never quite seemed to come out right.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"The Hotori standing here now must be very different from the Hotori in Kanami's memories.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Are you upset that I was Empress Hisui?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I've heard what you went through. I won't say anything of it.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But I do feel the same way that Soujin does.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I understand. I am a daughter of warriors, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Hotori lowers her head in sympathy, but Kanami silently shakes her head as an evanescent smile floats across her lips.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, I'm afraid I owe you an apology.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You see, Elsa-sama has discovered my true identity.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, she's already talked to us about that.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We decided to proceed with Operation Bellflower just as planned.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I'm so sorry... I never intended to let it slip, but...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's Elsa you were dealing with. Don't worry about it.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Thank you. That helps put me at ease.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not to say you owe us anything, but I have a request for you.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This comes from me and Hotori... No, from ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"all",
{"/font"},
" of the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What might it be?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Instead of working with Elsa, would you cooperate with us instead?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Kanami falls silent, pursing her lips.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"The distant sound of the sea drifts in on the wind.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I refuse.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I've decided to place my faith in Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"She flatly declares, fixing me with a resolute gaze.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I believe I have said this before, but I wish to put an end to the archaic system of Imperial rule.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am afraid that my goals are very different from those of the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But─”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, you intend to fight alongside the true Imperial Princess, do you not?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nh?!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Akari freezes up at her question.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I make an effort to keep my voice calm and conceal my inner agitation.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why do you think that?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Both your and Hotori-chan's fealty runs deep.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You ought find it unthinkable to restore the Empire with an impostor like me on the throne.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The only reason you are opposed to abolishing the Imperial system is because you are in contact with the true princess, is it not?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Her deductions are accurate every step of the way.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"If the Blades believed that Akari was dead and that Empress Hisui was an impostor from the start, we would have adopted a much different policy.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"For example, opting to meet an honorable end by mounting a futile last stand against the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I guess there's no use hiding it anymore...”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"At this, Kanami meets Akari's gaze.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Her initially dubious expression gradually stiffens into a hard glare.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“So you were the Imperial Princess this whole time...”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's right. I'm the daughter of Empress Suou, the last survivor of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“How could you?!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If you were alive this entire time, how could you refuse to do anything until now?!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Kanami reaches out and grabs Akari by the collar.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kanami!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stand down!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The warriors gave everything to protect the Empire─to protect the Imperial Family!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The Sworn Blades, too! They've worked tirelessly to restore the Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Why did you do nothing to save the warriors?!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Where was the Imperial Family when the warriors needed them most?!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It is too late for you to show up now... Everyone is already dead...”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"The strength slowly wilts from Kanami's arms, and she limply lets go of Akari before staggering backwards.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Akari squeezes her eyes shut, solemnly contemplating\nKanami's reprobation.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"I─and likely Hotori, too─can't understand Kanami's indignation.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"For country and fealty, we warriors would gladly face the battlefield without any hesitation in our hearts.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"However, the most that a warrior's family can do is to send them off with a smile and pray for their safe return.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"This difference in perspective must be why she is so outraged at the inaction of the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"She needs to understand for what reason her family and friends had to give up their lives.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I ask your forgiveness for my long absence.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was so obsessed with avenging my mother's death that I turned a blind eye to the warriors, even as they continued their brave struggle.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Had I acted sooner, the August Incident might never have happened.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The only thing I can offer the warriors is my sincere apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You may rest assured that I shall make amends with my own life for this negligence, as well as my failure to protect the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Akari's gaze does not waver from Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But before I do, there is one final duty I must fulfill.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I will not rest until I take back the Empire from the Republic and create a country where the people may live in peace.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It's too late for that!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Be that as it may, it's a duty I absolutely must fulfill, no matter how things turn out!”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I have to answer the resolve of the warriors who are still fighting.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin is the one who taught me that.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"She's speaking to the resolve demanded of a lord.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The resolve to see the battle through to its final conclusion, no matter how great or terrible it is.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin and Inou might get mad at me for this, but personally, I'm not too attached to the Imperial system.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If the people will it, I wouldn't care if the whole thing is abolished once we've taken back our country.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“After all, the Imperial Family failed in its sworn duty to protect the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's only fitting and proper to return these lands back to Oomikami.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"This time, Akari approaches Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're completely right. It's already far too late. So many things will never be the same again.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even so, I want that old Empire back.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That peaceful Empire where everyone lived in prosperity.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That Empire where you lived happily alongside Soujin and Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Akari gently takes Kanami's hands into her own.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Kanami offers no resistance.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Lend me your aid, Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“How cruel of you...”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Turning out to be a good person... after all this time...”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"With that, Kanami falls silent for some time.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Akari, Hotori, and I patiently wait for her to break her silence.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"The warriors themselves, the one who sends them unto battle, and the one who helplessly sees them off.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The feelings of each party differ as much as the resolve demanded of them.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Will Akari's sentiments manage to reach Kanami?",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I understand your intentions, Miyaguni-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I no longer have any opposition to cooperating with you.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Kanami raises her head to meet Akari's gaze head-on.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Even held in Akari's grip, her own hands tremble ever so faintly.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“However, I have three conditions.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Firstly.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Even if you are resolved to fight the Republic and expel them from the country, I ask that you spare Elsa-sama's life.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We're at war! There's no way we can guarantee that.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“As a daughter of warriors, I understand that much.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“However, the only reason I joined Operation Bellflower is because of her.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“She has my full confidence, and I refuse to allow you to take her life.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Very well. I promise.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Kanami nods.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“My second condition comes after we achieve all of our ambitions.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I ask that you allow the people to decide the fate of the Imperial institution and the question of the Empire's democratization.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am willing to accept that my resentment for the Imperial Family is merely a product of my own circumstances.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hence, I simply ask that you abide by the will of the people.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course. That was my plan all along.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Now, as for my final condition.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Kanami takes a small breath before continuing.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Allow me to have Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Akari & Soujin & Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?” “Hmm?” “Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"I don't understand what she's saying.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“C-Could you run that by me again, a little bit clearer this time?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It only has to be until I die, but I ask that you relinquish your right as Onii-sama's lord to me.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“W-Wait a minute!”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Akari lets go of Kanami's hand and staggers several steps back.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“S-Soujin is ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"my",
{"/font"},
" vassal, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I sold my soul to Okonogi and impersonated the Empress all for the sole purpose of finding Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The day that you announce yourself is the day I shall have to die for my grave trespasses.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Make no mistake, I harbor absolutely no grievances about this fact.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But if I am to die a lonely death after granting you my cooperation, all I ask is some small measure of satisfaction in return.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please, let me dream one last, final dream, at least until we manage to restore the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"There's not a single hint of humor in Kanami's expression.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Her gaze radiates nothing but an endlessly pure force of passion.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But that's─”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If I may be blunt, this whole arrangement is terribly one-sided.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“All of you will be able to fulfill your long-cherished ambitions, while I am the only one who gets the short end of the stick.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Kanami declares all this with a gentle smile.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"There's no doubt that she's fully prepared to die.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"And because she has cast aside all hesitation, she is willing to ask for her most cherished wish.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I...”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, why must you be so petty?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Kanami petulantly whines as she drapes herself over my arm.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaaaaahh!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hey, c'mon!”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Won't you come serve me, Onii-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Right now, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I",
{"/font"},
" am the Empress. Isn't it only natural for Her Majesty to have just one faithful servant?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"She peers up at me, imploring me with her round doe eyes.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kh... This is what it comes to...?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Akari bitterly grits her teeth.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, what say you?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"On one side, Kanami meekly presses her modest chest against my arm.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"On the other, Akari fiercely glares at me as though she's confronting her mother's killer.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I shall do as my lord wills.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Knew you'd freaking say that...”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Unless we accept her conditions, Kanami will refuse to work with us.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Especially now that Akari has outed herself, we need to secure her cooperation by hook or by crook.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Of course, Kanami faces a cruel dilemma of her own.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"If she does cooperate with the warriors, she'd essentially be signing her own death warrant.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"It would not be wrong to say that she is only reaping what she sowed, but she does at least deserve some recompense.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Plus, it's not like I'd be serving Kanami forever.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"It would only be a temporary arrangement, until we manage to restore the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-sama, would you give me Onii-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...No way.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“H-Hey now.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No means no!”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin vowed to place his life on the line, all for my sake.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's why I have to act like the sort of lord he can be proud to serve.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I refuse to be a lord who would sell her own vassals for personal gain.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"An involuntary chill runs up my spine.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"To think that she feels so strongly for me...",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oh, really now?”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Kanami sullenly lets go of my arm.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“In that case, I suppose you will not be needing my cooperation.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Perhaps I just might inform on you to Elsa-sama tonight.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Is that what you want?”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Akari narrows her eyes at this thinly-veiled threat.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"If Elsa learns of Akari's existence, she'll be able to piece together our true intentions to fight the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"And in that case, Akari's safety would be in grave danger.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait, Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"This time, I'm the one to reach out and grab Kanami's hand.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I accept your condition.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hold it! I already said no!”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You said you'd do whatever I willed!”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I take it back.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You think you can just take that back!? Who's the master here!?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If Elsa learns of your identity, your life will be in danger.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's your job to protect me when that happens!”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please understand.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's only until we restore the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wanted to do that with you by my side!”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You swore you'd fight alongside me!”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Akari is angry enough to burst into flames.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"At this point, it's honestly more refreshing than anything else.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will serve Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you dare!”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You need to calm down.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Nh!?”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Fine! Be that way, you big jerk!”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Akari runs off, practically spitting out her last words.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haah...”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"Hotori looks at me ruefully, letting out a deep sigh.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Hotori chases after her without another word.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"I'm sure that at least Hotori will understand that I made the right decision.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Uhh, um...”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"The two of us are the only ones left on the beach.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Are you truly okay with being mine from now on?”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oh, what a joyous day!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Kanami clings to my chest without a second thought.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sure you know, but this is only temporary.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I do not mind!”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And while we may not be connected by blood, we ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"are",
{"/font"},
" still brother and sister.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's not good for you to act so close.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I will naturally exercise the utmost restraint! Squeeze♪”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Kanami gleefully declares as she puts even more strength into her arms.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"I don't think she understands at all...",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			select={
				"If it's for the sake of the Empire, I should put up with it.",
				"It's my duty as her brother to answer her devotion in kind.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Does this mean you'll work with us from now on?”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes, I did promise.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Is there anything you would like me to do?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you see Elsa often?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“She comes to check in on me once every few days.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"Seems like they're in pretty close contact.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then for now, I want you to keep a close eye on her.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you notice anything suspicious, make sure to let me know.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Do you not trust Elsa-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We've been at each other's throats for years now. We can't trust her that easily.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And this goes without saying, but be absolutely sure to keep Akari a secret.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If Elsa finds out about her, her life will be in danger.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I understand that, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“However...”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"A conflicted expression crosses Kanami's face.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just to be safe.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Despite her unease, she eventually acquiesces.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, there was one other thing.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes! Anything at all!”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you know anything about the Three Sacred Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hmm, the Sacred Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have you seen them before?”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I only saw them once from afar, during my enthronement ceremony.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I was not able to touch them, however, and I do not know what happened to them after the ceremony.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"If she's talking about the implements used in the enthronement ceremony, then even I've seen them on the television.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Um, could it be that perhaps you intend to ask me to retrieve them?”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Like I'd ever have you do anything that dangerous!”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...I wish you would.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"For some reason, Kanami looks disappointed.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“According to Akari, the Treasures are stored in a pavilion called the Shireiden.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The Shireiden?”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"I explain what the Shireiden looks like from when I saw it.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That is very detailed. It is almost as though you've seen it in person.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I have.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hweh?”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A few days after the Armistice Day ceremony, did you happen to hear about intruders in the Imperial Palace?”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I was informed by Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Do you mean to say that was you, Onii-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“How could you dare to be so reckless?!”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"The very picture of worry, Kanami fusses herself with inspecting my body for injuries.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haha! I made it out in one piece, so let's leave it at that.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Don't you treat this as some laughing matter!”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you can, I'd like you to see if there's anything strange about the Shireiden.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When we snuck in, we caused a bit of a commotion.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's possible that Okonogi's relocated the Treasures.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes, yes, I will.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Your Kanami will handle all the investigating, so please, promise you will not do anything so reckless again.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right, all right.”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"I promptly placate my sulky baby sister.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hehee, this reminds me of old times.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“We used to have this exact exchange all the time before the war.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seems like I haven't changed one bit.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Indeed. My Onii-sama is the same silly goose he has always been.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"Kanami smiles a contented smile.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“To be of use to her Onii-sama is your Kanami's greatest joy.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You may count on her for every last thing.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. But please, keep yourself safe first and foremost.”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes!”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
		next={ block=241, label=3 },
	},
}
